# Audit ignores in YAML, keyed by the item id the audit prints.
#
#   <item_id>: <reason> (<who>, <when>)
#
# Prefer an inline `audit:ignore <rule-id> <reason>` comment on or above the
# flagged line; it moves with the code. Use this file only where no comment
# can go. See "Audit ignores" in .agents/rules/README.md.
#
# Audit ignores expire by construction: the item id contains the snippet, so
# changing the code retires the audit ignore automatically. Only a human adds a line here.
